    "description": "FOLKWARDEN MENTAL SOUL UTILITY WARDING\nFolkwarden Specialist Spell\nCast 1 AP (material, somatic)\nRange 30 feet\nTargets 1 willing creature\nDuration 1 minute\n\nYou trace or invoke a simple protective sign traditionally associated with hearth, home and personal safety.\nThe target gains a +1-status bonus to Will saving throws against:\nFear;\neffects with the Mental trait;\npossession; and\neffects with the Soul trait.\nHearthsign does not remove an effect already affecting the target.\n\nWarping Options:\n+1 PP: Target one additional willing creature.\n+2 PP: Increase the bonus by 1, to a maximum of +3.\n\nPillars of Faith, Chapter 10."
